sn12.18:2.13 | S: “It’s not that I don’t know or see pleasure and pain. | T: “It’s not the case that I don’t know, don’t see, pleasure & pain, Timbarukkha.
sn12.18:2.14 | S: I do know pleasure and pain, | T: I do know pleasure & pain.
